+
+    // =====================================================================
+    // D7 — agentLoans[] grows without bound; resetPoolAccounting walks it
+    // [FIXED 2026-09-22] `resetPoolAccounting` rebuilds totalLoaned from
+    // `activeLoanIds[agentId]` (<= MAX_ACTIVE_LOANS_PER_AGENT = 10), not from the
